_authentication on the authorization-code grants. ApacheHttpClient(CookieStore) and HttpClient expose the store; a supplied store survives client rebuilds and is never cleared. Each exchange records into a per-request wrapper, so only cookies set during that exchange (redirect hops included) merge into Set-Cookie, and the client's own store is cleared in finally, so a request that throws no longer leaks its cookies into the next. The response's end time is stamped after the body is read. AuthorizationCodeAuthHandler and OAuth2TokenManager (code exchange and refresh) read client_authentication: 'header' sends the client as HTTP Basic, as the client-credentials and password grants do (shared ClientCredentialsAuthHandler helper). DESIGN says so. Failing first: ApacheHttpClientCookieStoreTest (leak: expected null but was leak=1; hop-only merge), ApacheHttpClientTest timing (took 84 ms against a 300 ms floor), AuthorizationCodeAuthHandlerTest and OAuth2TokenManagerTest header cases (expected Basic … but was null). karate-core 2992/0 (3 skipped).","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"elizaOS/eliza","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:29:07Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"e8e1d3dd72076e3122ab1f6e061bf1173124c74f","github_link":"https://github.com/elizaOS/eliza/commit/e8e1d3dd72076e3122ab1f6e061bf1173124c74f","commit_subject":"fix(assistant): replan pending work after a prepared app-view navigation","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"omerbenamram/evtx","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:29:01Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"46590cad4eddcc5acdfb06388ac4309095b10849","github_link":"https://github.com/omerbenamram/evtx/commit/46590cad4eddcc5acdfb06388ac4309095b10849","commit_subject":"Merge branch 'master' into claude/project-thread-j03xxp-render-budget","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"linebender/vello","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:28:31Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"d29a0180489aac452803b7e3b15e1285d8c738cb","github_link":"https://github.com/linebender/vello/commit/d29a